  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "A Perfect Day in Singapore",
   "size": "EXTRA_LARGE",
   "variant": "HEADLINE"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>17. June 2025 | 3 min read | Florian Tomberg</b>",
   "size": "SMALL",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Experience Singapore like an insider: purser Florian Tomberg takes us on his perfect day in the Asian metropolis – full of culinary highlights and insider tips.</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Morning</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-singapore/lh_app_watermelon-juice_shutterstock-1992470564_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "Person holding cup of watermelon juice"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Start With A Workout</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>Exercise is my tip for beating jet lag, which is why I start my morning with a session at the hotel gym</li><li>To cool down afterwards, I treat myself to a freshly squeezed orange juice from one of the many street-side juice machines you’ll find all over Singapore</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "spacer",
   "size": "MEDIUM"
  },
  {
