  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Afternoon</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-singapore/lh_app_singapore_jay-ang_unsplash-v0BgDZTJyPY_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "View of the Merlion Lion in Singapore"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Leisurely Brunch at PS.Cafe Harding Road</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>I head to Dempsey Hill, a charming area filled with cafés, restaurants, and shops</li><li>What I love most about PS.Cafe Harding Road: the cozy, floral-inspired interior, the Avocado Eggs Florentine, and the irresistible Truffle Fries</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "28b Harding Rd",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Ride to the Arab Quarter</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>Getting around Singapore is easy with public transport – buses and the MRT are punctual, and accept Apple Pay</li><li>Alternatively, there’s Grab, Southeast Asia’s version of Uber</li><li>A visit to the stunning Sultan Mosque is a must, as is a stroll through nearby Haji Lane, a narrow street full of unique boutiques, cozy bars, and fantastic restaurants</li><li>My recommendation: homemade mint lemonade is perfect for the tropical heat, as are freshly pressed watermelon or guava juice</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Sultan Mosque (Masjid Sultan), 3 Muscat St",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-singapore/lh_app_singapore_garden-by-the-bay_shutterstock368696480_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "Interior view of the Gardens by the Bay in Singapore"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>The Many Sights of Marina Bay</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>At the mouth of the Singapore River stands the iconic Merlion statue, more than eight meters tall, watching over the city and its people</li><li>A must-see: the breathtaking view of Marina Bay Sands, a hotel with a spectacular rooftop infinity pool</li><li>Just behind the hotel are the Gardens by the Bay, home to the magical Supertrees</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Evening</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-singapore/lh_app_singapore_rooftop-bar_ce-la-vie_ory3942_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "Night shot at the rooftop bar Cé La Vi in Singapore"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Light It Up at Gardens by the Bay</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>When the sun goes down, tourists and locals alike gather here for the light show – a mesmerizing spectacle that never gets old</li><li>My tip: book a sunset boat tour, as seeing Singapore from the water offers a completely different and unforgettable perspective</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "18 Marina Gardens Dr",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Cocktails at Cé La Vi</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>My ultimate insider tip: sip cocktails at Cé La Vi rooftop bar at the Marina Bay Sands Hotel</li><li>Normally, only hotel guests are allowed on the rooftop of the 57th floor – but anyone heading to Cé La Vi can enjoy the same stunning view</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "10 Bayfront Ave",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Copyrights: Shutterstock, Jay Ang/Unsplash, Marina Bay Sands, Rory Daniel",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>About</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Florian Tomberg lives in Cologne and has been working for Lufthansa since 2016. As a purser, he often flys from Frankfurt to Singapore.",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
